<div class="min-h-screen bg-[#14161c] text-zinc-100">
  <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-4xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-16 text-center">
    <img
      src={~p"/images/avatars.png"}
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="mb-8 h-24 w-auto [image-rendering:pixelated] [clip-path:inset(0_0_75%_0)]"
    />

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      A room your team can walk around in
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      Breakaway is a 2D coworking floor. Everyone gets an avatar, the desks are real
      places, and the meeting rooms are wired to Discord voice channels — walk into
      one and you are in the call.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <.link
        href={~p"/sign-in"}
        class="rounded-xl bg-indigo-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20 hover:bg-indigo-400"
      >
        Sign in with Discord
      </.link>
      <.link
        href={~p"/office"}
        class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Enter the office
      </.link>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-16 grid w-full gap-4 text-left sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-[#1a1d24] p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold">Presence you can see</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          Server-authoritative movement at 20Hz. Who is at their desk, who is in a
          room, who is by the coffee machine.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-[#1a1d24] p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold">Rooms that are calls</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          Bind a meeting room to a Discord voice channel. Crossing the threshold
          moves you in; walking out takes you back.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-[#1a1d24] p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold">One identity</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          The Discord account you sign in with is the account we move between
          channels. Nothing else to set up.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>
